      "q": "Which elementary school is in the Quilchena pocket?",
      "a": "Quilchena Elementary School is at 3760 Moresby Drive, Richmond, on its School District 38 site; for that sample address the SD38 locator gives Quilchena Elementary and Boyd Secondary, and Hugh Boyd Secondary at 9200 No. 1 Road lists Quilchena Elementary among its feeder elementary schools.",
