      "q": "Is this area in a floodplain?",
      "a": "Yes, on City evidence: Richmond is islands in the Fraser River floodplain protected by 49 km of dikes and pump stations designed for a 1:500 event, and all lands in the City are designated flood plain under Bylaw No. 8204 with flood construction levels.",
